WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,870
Sister Meng

2
00:00:00,920 --> 00:00:04,320
Please help me deposit this check into that card for 100,000

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,000
You just took an order

4
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:09,200
Why did he give you so much money? What did you do, Sister Meng?

5
00:00:09,520 --> 00:00:10,800
He just wants a stable

6
00:00:11,120 --> 00:00:12,040
A stable

7
00:00:12,520 --> 00:00:14,040
Don’t see this person again

8
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:18,710
what's going on

9
00:00:19,270 --> 00:00:21,310
It's okay if you hit the door accidentally

10
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:23,060
It’s okay if you don’t say it

11
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:25,060
I'll call Mr. Shen and Sister Meng

12
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:27,780
Mr. Shen doesn't care what I do

13
00:00:28,350 --> 00:00:29,390
Don’t call Mr. Shen

14
00:00:29,630 --> 00:00:30,590
I'll call Manager Xu.

15
00:00:30,590 --> 00:00:31,550
Don’t call him Manager Xu

16
00:00:32,030 --> 00:00:34,150
I said I hit the door handle

17
00:00:34,510 --> 00:00:35,470
It rained that day

18
00:00:35,710 --> 00:00:36,710
Dizziness and blurred vision

19
00:00:37,030 --> 00:00:40,830
The wound on your forehead hasn’t healed yet. Go back and recuperate. I’m not Sister Meng.

20
00:00:41,350 --> 00:00:42,670
If you really feel sorry for me

21
00:00:42,830 --> 00:00:44,190
Just introduce me to some more jobs.

22
00:00:44,190 --> 00:00:55,910
You go out first. Who gave him the money?

23
00:00:55,910 --> 00:00:57,150
Isn't it

24
00:00:57,150 --> 00:00:58,910
What did he do this time?

25
00:00:59,270 --> 00:01:00,590
What are you trying to help him hide?
